rmation": [], "observations": ["Window opens 1780099200000 at 2013.41 and falls to a 1368.42 low at 1780704000000, whose close of 1568.55 is 200.13 above its low (wide bear legs with a large final lower tail).", "1780790400000-1787011200000 (73 bars) overlap inside a 1512.91 (1782432000000 low) to 1974.46 (1785110400000 high) range; lows rise from 1512.91 to 1868.51 while highs stall at 1944.39-1974.46.", "The last 13 bars of that range (1786060800000-1787011200000) are small overlapping bars clustering in 1868.51-1937.76 directly before the expansion.", "Bar 1787097600000 opens 1916.51, closes 2252.16, with a 2293.8 high: a 388.17-range bull bar closing 277.70 above the prior 1974.46 range top.", "1787270400000 extends to 2771, then 1787356800000-1788998400000 (20 bars) overlap between 2357.18 (1788307200000 low) and 2557.46 (1787788800000 high).", "Bar 1789084800000 spikes to 2680 but closes 2514.72, 165.28 below that high and back inside the 20-bar range; 1789430400000 then puts in a 2358.62 low, 1.44 above the 2357.18 low.", "1789689600000-1789948800000 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9 and 2775.61, clearing the 2557.46 range top and the 2771 spike high; the 1789948800000 high is 2850, 74.39 above its close.", "1789948800000-1790467199999 (last five bars) overlap inside 2633.31-2786.81; the final bar opens 2690.56, closes 2694.96 at 2695.17 high and 2665.14 low, still 155.04 below the 2850 high."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Sell climax / bear leg: five wide bear bars drive from 2030.49 down to 1368.42, ending with a large lower tail on 1780704000000 (close 1568.55).", "end_time_ms": 1780703999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780099200000, "upper_boundary": "2030.49"}, {"description": "Large overlapping trading range after the sell-off: 1512.91-1974.46 over 73 bars, with gradually rising lows and capped highs